SUMMARY:CARRIX INC — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: CARRIX INC\nRoadshow: https://www.netroadshow.com/events/login/1Pe
 THmojCnJdQVi29QygpmUj0fgfqMirAh4pd\n\nDeal context:\nCarrix\, Inc. is laun
 ching a $2.5 billion Senior Secured Notes offering (Ba1/BBB- rated) with a
  7-year tenor\, structured as 144A/Reg S for life\, as part of a broader $
 5.5 billion financing package that also includes a $2.5 billion Term Loan 
 B and $500 million Delayed Draw Term Loan B. The notes feature a 3-year no
 n-call period with a declining call schedule (par plus 50%/25%/0% of coupo
 n)\, a 10% annual redemption at 103% during the non-call period\, and a 40
 % equity clawback provision. Proceeds will be used alongside the term loan
  proceeds to fully repay existing indebtedness\, fund a distribution\, and
  provide cash for general corporate purposes including ongoing growth proj
 ects\, with RBC acting as Lead Left B&D bookrunner alongside 12 joint book
 runners and Blackstone as co-manager.
